      "message": "I\u0027d rather use DeviceConfigUtils.isFeatureEnabled(namespace, name). It\u0027s not that important for flags that only affect S+ where flags are cleared on rollback (although the timing of that is unclear), but it\u0027s better to have consistency between all of our flags; especially if the intent is to do a flag push, as our server-side configs generally use that style of flags. In that case the flag should be named automatic_on_off_keepalive_version.\n\nAlso it avoids having to define 0\u003dENABLED, 1\u003dDISABLED manually :)",
